WEBVTT

00:10:29.075 --> 00:10:31.900
provide services without obstacles

00:10:32.678 --> 00:10:35.504
and provide patients what they need --

00:10:36.257 --> 00:10:38.109
not what we think they need.

00:10:39.625 --> 00:10:43.508
It's impossible for me
to take good care of a patient

00:10:43.532 --> 00:10:45.925
who is homeless and living on the street.

00:10:46.933 --> 00:10:51.443
The right prescription
for a homeless patient is housing.

00:10:52.474 --> 00:10:54.288
In Los Angeles,

00:10:54.312 --> 00:11:00.342
we housed 4,700 chronically
homeless persons